She didn't have cats.

32
00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:29.540
She took it down.

33
00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:33.140
It was a gift from Angela Martin that Angela Martin took back.

34
00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:39.900
Well, Jenna, in our breakdown of the Dundies, we also discussed the moment when Pam kisses Jim.

35
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:45.620
We got a fan question asking if we thought it was their first kiss or if that was actually

36
00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:46.700
