37
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:47.860
We disagree.

38
00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.620
We have talked about this quite a bit.

39
00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.420
I have said it was their first kiss.

40
00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:52.740
I said that it was not.

41
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.740
Well, I have found something to share about that kiss.

42
00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:57.400
I know.

43
00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:01.580
You've been real excited to hit me with this.

44
00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:02.400
I have.

45
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.720
You know, I don't know if it really clears anything up, but it just gives a little bit

46
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:06.460
more insight.

47
00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:11.380
Well, what I think you mean is that it's been more evidence to prove your opinion.

48
00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:12.700
No, no.

49
00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.240
You hear it and you tell me.

50
00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:14.620
Okay.

51
00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:19.800
I think maybe all it does is bomb detective this, which is like, well, we're back where

52
00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:20.320
we started.

53
00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.060
Well, let's see.

54
00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.240
So I went back and I read the shooting draft.

55
00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:25.780
We did not share this the first time we watched.

56
00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:28.960
Here's what it said in the stage direction.

57
00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:29.900
Are you ready?

58
00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:33.660
Right after Pam says, but mostly I want to thank God.

59
00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.860
She says, I feel God in this Chili's.

60
00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:36.500
Don't you?

61
00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:41.160
And the stage direction says, Jim looks at Pam with admiration.

62
00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:43.900
Dwight turns on the wrap it up music.

63
00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:48.480
Pam grabs Michael and kisses him, leaving him speechless.

64
00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:53.480
Dwight hits a button on the Casio and we hear the, oh yeah, cue.

65
00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:56.740
Pam skips off the stage and back to her seat.

66
00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:03.620
As Jim pulls the seat out for the Dundee winner, Pam impulsively grabs him and kisses him before

