86
00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:10.040
This is what we were always told.

87
00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:10.500
Yeah.

88
00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:11.860
That's what everyone told us.

89
00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:15.180
That's sort of the lore that we were like, oh my goodness, they had a real Chili's person.

90
00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:15.580
Yes.

91
00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.060
That's what Greg believed.

92
00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.920
