95
00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:26.500
His name is Christopher T.

96
00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.040
Jones.

97
00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:31.220
And Christopher, please accept our sincerest apologies.

98
00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:32.680
Oh my goodness, Christopher.

99
00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.940
We had no idea.

100
00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:41.700
I was reading Andy Green's book about the office and Christopher is interviewed.

101
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.920
And here is what he said.

102
00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:48.800
Quote, I was hired by the fantastic Alison Jones to work on the

103
00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:51.760
40-year-old virgin with Steve Carell as a cop.

104
00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:56.020
The scene I did was cut, but it made the deleted scenes on the DVD.

105
00:04:56.420 --> 00:05:01.080
I guess I did well enough because they brought me in to audition for the office.

106
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:06.200
He went on to say, I think at least some of the extras were Chili's employees.

107
00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:11.980
And the reason I say that is because almost everyone assumed that I was actually a Chili's

108
00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:12.460
manager.

109
00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.380
So maybe that's where the mix-up happened.

110
00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:15.840
Yes.

111
00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:16.500
Because we did.

112
00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:22.200
I have such a memory of having Chili's people on set to make sure we got the whole Chili's

113
00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:22.740
of it right.

114
00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:23.540
Yes.

115
00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.760
And we talk about this in our breakdown.

116
00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:32.220
It was a surprise to the Chili's folks that Pam was going to get drunk and Pam is supposed

117
00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.120
