118
00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:37.740
And they were on set and they were like, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no vomiting.

119
00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:40.940
She can fall off a stool, but she can't throw up.

120
00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:46.100
