121
00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:46.500
head.

122
00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.620
Like all of that kind of happened on the set.

123
00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:54.880
So there were really Chili's people there and they were in the background of some scenes.

124
00:05:55.760 --> 00:06:02.400
Well, poor Christopher said that he has been on Twitter trying to debunk this fact.

125
00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.100
And he said, people don't believe him.

126
00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:07.200
They're like, no, you are a Chili's manager.

127
00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:10.760
