128
00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.820
And he said, I guess I should take it as a compliment toward my acting.

129
00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:20.060
But Christopher, since I didn't do it in this episode, I would like to give you a proper

130
00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.340
