131
00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:28.760
According to his IMDb bio, Christopher has been a working actor in Los Angeles since 2002.

132
00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:34.880
He has appeared on numerous TV programs like Everybody Loves Raymond, Arrested Development,

133
00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:41.100
Joey, Two and a Half Men, ER, NCIS, Superstore, to just name a few.

134
00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:44.220
And he was most recently in the movie Barbie.

135
00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.360
Well, Christopher, I really hope this clears things up for you.

136
00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:50.520
We're going to put the word out in our office family community

137
00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:56.360
that you were not a Chili's employee, that you are, in fact, an actor playing a role that

138
00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:59.920
