1102
00:44:14.530 --> 00:44:15.290
We never find out.

1103
00:44:15.370 --> 00:44:15.950
We don't know.

1104
00:44:16.230 --> 00:44:19.530
But anyway, it just cracked me up because I would look back there and I'd be like,

1105
00:44:19.610 --> 00:44:20.610
oh, who's Oscar sitting with?

1106
00:44:20.730 --> 00:44:20.850
What?

1107
00:44:21.070 --> 00:44:21.190
What?

1108
00:44:21.330 --> 00:44:21.430
Huh?

1109
00:44:21.530 --> 00:44:21.710
What?

1110
00:44:21.830 --> 00:44:21.950
Huh?

1111
00:44:22.030 --> 00:44:23.890
But it was like a matter of seconds.

1112
00:44:24.610 --> 00:44:24.810
Wow.

