Also, it looks like something from like a Nickelodeon slime, like, award show.

1179
00:46:32.850 --> 00:46:37.490
Because like, have you, do you see, like, if you look at Meredith's drink, it's like a neon green.

1180
00:46:37.850 --> 00:46:38.110
Yeah.

1181
00:46:38.190 --> 00:46:38.970
What was she drinking?

1182
00:46:39.230 --> 00:46:39.770
I don't know.

1183
00:46:39.770 --> 00:46:42.990
But I think they really wanted the drinks to pop so you could see them.

1184
