00:47:16.390 --> 00:47:18.750
Sometimes they'll brew you some tea and pour it over ice.

1201
00:47:18.870 --> 00:47:19.450
And then now you have...

1202
00:47:19.450 --> 00:47:20.590
I'm actually happy when you have that.

1203
00:47:20.690 --> 00:47:23.190
Like if you have a Long Island iced tea in it, you're just drinking an iced tea.

1204
00:47:23.330 --> 00:47:23.510
Yeah.

1205
00:47:23.510 --> 00:47:28.710
Sam just pulled up for you guys listening a whole page on the internet of just me rolling

1206
00:47:28.710 --> 00:47:30.430
my eyes and looking snarky.

