I feel God in this Chili's tonight.

1236
00:48:54.350 --> 00:48:54.710
Aw.

1237
00:48:54.750 --> 00:48:55.710
I love it.

1238
00:48:56.470 --> 00:49:00.310
So when I rewatched this, there was this moment I wrote on my note card because

1239
